a Al-Balad — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Tafsirin Sura Al-Balad — Ma&#x27;anonin Alkur&#x27;ani a cikin maganganun Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Balad\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/90.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › Sura Al-Balad</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Balad — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</h1><section><p>Ayoyin wannan sura da ke da bayani:</p><div class=\"vl\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/90-4.html\">4</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/90-5.html\">5</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/90-7.html\">7</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/90-8.html\">8</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/90-9.html\">9</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/90-10.html\">10</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/90-11.html\">11</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/90-17.html\">17</a></div></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s90a1\">Bude a